Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:53.90,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,257,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(5049,5350,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}隐藏的谎言以及浑浊的过去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:22:02.44,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,337,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(8214,8460,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}都将融化在这温流之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.33,0:22:16.51,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,204,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(4885,5180,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}雨声绵绵
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.57,0:22:20.79,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,210,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(3962,4220,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}坠落绽开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.75,0:22:27.02,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,340,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(4994,5270,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}倒映在水面上的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:30.86,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,335,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(3525,3780,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}轻轻摇摆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:36.54,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(5422,5640,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}即便如此依然还是会冲动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.58,0:22:42.10,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,224,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(5194,5520,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}加速追赶那片云
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.16,0:22:47.11,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,348,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(4666,4950,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}多少次伸出手依然无法触及
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.23,0:22:52.70,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,263,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(5201,5470,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}隐藏的谎言以及浑浊的过去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.82,0:23:00.19,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,288,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(7143,7370,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}都将融化在这温流之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正艺黑简体\bord1.5\fs80\shad5\blur4\fad(400,1000)\c&HF6F2F2&\1a&H00&\3c&HBA1000&\4c&HBB1000&\3a&H34&\pos(1648,926)}泪之圆月
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是水无月泪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.81,0:23:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,—只兔子 两只兔子 三只兔子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四只兔子 五只兔子 六只兔子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.49,0:23:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七只兔子 八只兔子 九只兔子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十只兔子 十一只兔子 十二只免子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 泪之圆月
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.67,0:23:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪啊 月兔能说话吗？
